      "briefTitle": "Safety and Efficacy of Proellex in Pre-menopausal Anemic Women With Symptomatic Uterine Fibroids",
      "officialTitle": "A Multi-Center, Placebo Controlled, Safety and Efficacy Study of the Selective Progesterone Receptor Modulator Proellex® (CDB-4124) in Anemic, Pre-Menopausal Women With Symptomatic Uterine Fibroids Requiring Hysterectomy"
